        "Product traceability module for an industrial company. Tracks lot, supplier, processes, and final destination for each product. Includes QR scanning for mobile tracking and real-time KPI dashboards. Built with Vue.js and Flask, with a PostgreSQL database.",
      type: "Web App",
      year: "2022",
